steps.instruction:
Build the application and confirm that no new `TS2322` type assignment errors are reported for templates that use two-way bindings, e.g. `[(ngModel)]` or custom `[(foo)]` bindings. **Before/after:**
```typescript
// 19.0.0: no type check on the event side
someOutput.subscribe($event => expr);

// 19.1.0: event side is type checked
someOutput.subscribe($event => {
  var _t1 = unwrapSignalValue(this.someField);
  _t1 = $event;
});
```
